/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 84 0 R
/T (Source:  public Lending Club export \(Kaggle\); 36-month loans only, so every loan matures before the data ends and no outcome is censored. Target:  charged-off vs fully paid; loans still in flight are excluded. The leakage filter is the hard work:  the raw export has 151 columns, most of them post-origination servicing fields \(payments received, recoveries, hardship flags\) that trivially predict the outcome. I kept an explicit whitelist of 23 origination-time fields. Out-of-time split:  train on 2007-2013 vintages, calibrate on 2014, test on 2015, exactly how a deployed model meets the future. The rising default rate across vintages is the drift a real model faces.)
/E (Source:  public Lending Club export \(Kaggle\); 36-month loans only, so every loan matures before the data ends and no outcome is censored. Target:  charged-off vs fully paid; loans still in flight are excluded. The leakage filter is the hard work:  the raw export has 151 columns, most of them post-origination servicing fields \(payments received, recoveries, hardship flags\) that trivially predict the outcome. I kept an explicit whitelist of 23 origination-time fields. Out-of-time split:  train on 2007-2013 vintages, calibrate on 2014, test on 2015, exactly how a deployed model meets the future. The rising default rate across vintages is the drift a real model faces.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
